>
  <h2>What this is</h2>
  <p>
    Cognitive decline rarely announces itself. Most men in their late 30s through 60s notice
    creeping gaps — slower recall, reduced focus under pressure, harder time switching tasks —
    years before any clinical threshold is crossed. The good news is that the brain is highly
    plastic and responds to the right inputs at any age.
  </p>
  <p>
    The Mind pillar of the 4M framework treats cognitive performance as a trainable,
    measurable outcome, not a fixed trait. We use validated screening tools to establish
    your baseline and track progress over time.
  </p>

  <h2>Our approach</h2>
  <div class="card-grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Baseline Screen</h3>
      <p>Connected Mind validated cognitive screen — establishes where you are today so we can measure change.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Dual N-Back Training</h3>
      <p>The most studied working-memory protocol. Done 5 days/week in the app as part of your Mind daily habit.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Sleep & Recovery Alignment</h3>
      <p>Cognitive output tracks sleep debt closely. Your sleep protocol is built alongside this plan.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Nutrition Substrate</h3>
      <p>Ancestral-pattern eating reduces neuroinflammatory load. Linked to the My4MLife nutrition protocol.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <fragment slot="product-cta">
    <h3>Cognitive Screen</h3>
    <p>Connected Mind validated screen — track your baseline and 90-day progress.</p>
    <a href="/consult" class="btn-sol secondary">Request Screen</a>
  </fragment>
</SolutionPage>
